./v2_bench --journal-threads 8 --primary-thread-count 3 --initial-log-count 4 \
    --op-count $((500*1000*1000)) --track-percentiles \
    --min-message-size 128 --max-message-size 128 --zipf-factor 0.0001 \
    --wal-flush-interval-us 0 --log-creation-interval-ms 500 --print-interval-ms 1000 \
    --max-log-push-interval-ms 2 --thread-placement unpinned --io-mode manual-poll --wal mock


them implement a fragment len on the packet header, parse the the fragments into separate iobufs and
  keep a leftover/partial segment per socket if udp also for receiving partial datagrams(if this is not
